    oa:canonical true ;
    oa:eventKind oa:Transferred ;
    oa:note "\"when they became part of the Mutual Progress Alliance in 3007 they began to consider a number of more unusual projects\" Article says \"Mutual Progress Alliance\"; the roster's matching polity is the Mutual Progress Association (MPA), which the panel's \"Allegiance: MPA\" and the roster's own alias both support as the same body. Flagged for the reviewer. 'Mutual Progress Alliance' as the article spells it." ;
